{"ref":"BDB, בָּרוּךְ","hw":"בָּרוּךְ","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">בָּרוּךְ</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong><em>blessed</em><strong>) </strong><br><strong>1.</strong>  friend and amanuensis of Jeremiah <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 32:12\" href=\"/Jeremiah.32.12\">Je 32:12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 32:13\" href=\"/Jeremiah.32.13\">13</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 32:16\" href=\"/Jeremiah.32.16\">16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 36:4-32\" href=\"/Jeremiah.36.4-32\">36:4–32</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 43:3\" href=\"/Jeremiah.43.3\">43:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 43:6\" href=\"/Jeremiah.43.6\">6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 45:1\" href=\"/Jeremiah.45.1\">45:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 45:2\" href=\"/Jeremiah.45.2\">2</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  a priest, son of Zabbai (Zaccai) <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 3:20\" href=\"/Nehemiah.3.20\">Ne 3:20</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 10:7\" href=\"/Nehemiah.10.7\">10:7</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  son of Colhozeh, of the tribe of Judah <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 11:5\" href=\"/Nehemiah.11.5\">Ne 11:5</a>.","next":"BDB, בְּרֵכָה","prev":"BDB, בְּרָכָה"}